### Engagement Metrics
- **Team Participation**: 100% attendance at standups
- **Stakeholder Engagement**: ≥80% stakeholder meeting attendance
- **Feedback Integration**: ≥90% of feedback items addressed

### Value Metrics
- **Canvas Completeness**: All 9 building blocks defined
- **Evidence Quality**: ≥5 evidence entries with high confidence
- **Risk Coverage**: ≥10 risks identified and assessed

